一を決めよう。 2026年度日本チャンピオンを決める国内最大の大会です。 FMCを除く、WCA公式競技16種目を開催します。 FMC競技については、別日に開催します。こちらよりお申し込みください。 [Japan FMC Championship 2026] (https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/JapanFMCChampionship2026) 本大会の決勝ラウンドにはWCA規則[9p2b](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/#9p2b)を適用し、最低50%の日本国籍の競技者が決勝戦に進出します。 主催: Japan Championship 2026 実行委員会 後援: 一般社団法人スピードキュービングジャパン 協力: 大阪キューブ会 / くるくる会 This competition will determine the **2026 Japan National Champion**. **Important: Language Requirement** This competition is held to determine the National Champion of Japan. Please note that all proceedings, announcements, and interactions with judges will be conducted exclusively in Japanese. Please be advised that we cannot accommodate personal interpreters within the competition area. In accordance with WCA Regulation [9p2b](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/#9p2b), a nationality quota will be applied to the final rounds of this competition. For all final rounds, at least 50% of the finalists shall represent Japan. Organized by: Japan Championship 2026 Organizing Committee Supported by: Speedcubing Japan In cooperation with: Osaka Cube / Kurukuru Kai","externalWebsite":"NULL","region":"JP"},{"id":"JapanFMCChampionship2026","name":"Japan FMC Championship 2026","city":"Daito, Osaka","country":"JP","date":{"from":"2026-07-04","till":"2026-07-04","numberOfDays":1},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333fm"],"wcaDelegates":[{"name":"Asami Ohkusa","email":"aohkusa@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Ryutaro Miyazaki (宮崎隆太郎)","email":"rmiyazaki@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Yuichi Hamada (濵田祐一)","email":"yhamada@worldcubeassociation.org"}],"organisers":[{"name":"Asami Ohkusa","email":"aohkusa@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Ryutaro Miyazaki (宮崎隆太郎)","email":"rmiyazaki@worldcubeassociation.org"},{"name":"Takayuki Tanaka (田中隆喜)","email":"cubingmush@gmail.com"},{"name":"Tomoki Moriyama (森山智樹)","email":"5120tm@gmail.com"},{"name":"Yasunari Kumekawa (粂川泰成)","email":"